  "description": "Heo Yoon is an aspiring singer who has had bad luck from the day she was born, a candidate for a divine audition called 'SHOW ME THE GRACE' named 'Andre' enters her life?!\n\nWith every touch, Andre's divine power can be felt!  \nAs Yoon falls for Andre's promise to make her live an ordinary life,  \nShe ends up signing a contract as Andre's manager for the divine audition!\n\nWhile living together with Andre, secrets about her own misfortunes start to unravel...  \nCan Heo Yoon really catch both her dream and grace, like chasing after two rabbits?\" (by GenZ Simps Translations)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=799868), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8845689)",
